Z||000000||dodger||06-15-2000||01:43 AM||||Today I saw I Fiero by the side of the road and decided to leave a note on it. Golden Gate Fieros has a flier to introduce the club and the Fiero Shop. So I wrote on it "This is a great resource", and signed my name and phone number. The car was at the top of Laurelas Grade (northern California). It was a light brown 84, I think. <BR>Well tonight I got a phone message. A guy wanted me to know that my Fiero was still there at the top of the grade, and since I am giving it away, please give him a call!<BR>I hope the owner didn't leave the keys in it. This guy might drive it away!<BR>Odd...||||reg||10
Z||000001||Phaeton||06-15-2000||02:19 AM||||Your generosity is congratulated, but perhaps a complicated map with difficult directions to the key would weed out the more undeserving.||||reg||12
